# =============================================================================
# Harness Service — Production Environment Reference
# =============================================================================
# Reference template — fill in for your deployment. Not loaded by the app
# itself; production is configured by whichever mechanism your deployment
# uses (K8s ConfigMap/Secret, systemd EnvironmentFile=) to populate the host
# environment. Relocated from the monorepo-root `.env.production` (TASK-584).
# =============================================================================

# LLM-as-judge (harness eval). vllm/llama-cpp reuse the OpenAI-compat judge
# client — point HARNESS_JUDGE_OPENAI_COMPAT_BASE_URL at the engine `/v1`.
# This is LLM-as-eval INFRASTRUCTURE (the harness's own judge model for
# scoring runs), not a tenant-facing provider/model default — it is
# legitimately env-tier per 09-infrastructure-devops.md and is exempt from
# the "no provider selection default in env" invariant that applies to
# tenant-facing generation (TEXT/TTS/STT/guardrail).
HARNESS_JUDGE_PROVIDER=openai_compat
HARNESS_JUDGE_MODEL=google/gemma-4-e4b-qat
HARNESS_JUDGE_OPENAI_COMPAT_BASE_URL=http://hope-vllm:8000/v1
